It is very warm this morning.
I am now in the Ernakulam market.
Many people are buying things.
There is a loud noise all around.
The vendors are calling out loudly.
They are selling fresh vegetables and fruits.
I want some supplies for this week.
I have cloth bags with me.
I take out a bag.
I walk slowly through the market.
There are many types of shops here.
I want to buy vegetables first.
